# Direct dependencies for the scripts/dev/seed_chain.sh toolchain.
#
# btcli is deliberately NOT a project dependency: the validator runtime keeps
# its own locked dependency set, and the seeder is a dev/CI-only tool. Install
# it into a throwaway virtualenv, never into the .venv the neurons run from.
#
# Regenerate the hash-locked set after editing this file:
#   uv pip compile --generate-hashes \
#     scripts/dev/seeder-requirements.in -o scripts/dev/seeder-requirements.txt
